Also, there should be entries in the root crontab that call /usr/sbin/dirclean
that purge old entries in /tmp and /var/tmp...The entries would be something like:

   20 4 * * * /usr/sbin/dirclean -t +2 -o -k s /tmp/
   30 4 * * * /usr/sbin/dirclean -t +7 -o -k s /var/tmp/

Harris


