If you are using AdvFS, you can use clonefset (8) to create a snapshot
of the filesystem. Then you can backup the snapshot.
That way, the backup is almost identical the system at the backup time
and your apps still run.

Ideally you need to backup the apps data using the apps backup
utilities.

